The legal texts come from the Journal Officiel de la République Gabonaise (www.journal-officiel.ga), retrieved
29 October 2026:

  Constitution de la République gabonaise (loi n°3/91 du 26 mars 1991, modifiée jusqu'à la loi n°046/2020), retrieved
29 October 2026; and, retrieved 30 October 2026, the Code pénal (loi n°006/2020 du 30 juin 2020) and the Code civil,
première partie (loi n°15/72 du 29 juillet 1972, as consolidated on the site), with the texts of loi n°005/2021 and
loi n°004/2021 that were applied to them.

The site publishes no licence for its legislation pages. They are the public law of the Republic of Gabon,
reproduced with the attribution above; their copyright status is not confirmed here.

Changes made by Lexifina: the page was converted to one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph or item per line;
spacing, quotes and dashes were normalised; amendment notes in headings and signature blocks were left out. The
wording of the law was not changed. Neither the Journal Officiel nor the Government of Gabon endorses this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
